 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Indonesia EV Dataset Wrangling & Specification Enhancement\n",
    "\n",
    "**Role:** Lead Data Analyst  \n",
    "**Project:** EVFlow — Indonesia EV Fleet & Charging Infrastructure Intelligence  \n",
    "\n",
    "## Executive Summary\n",
    "This notebook performs end-to-end data wrangling and dataset integration for Indonesia's Electric Vehicle (EV) dataset (`ev_dataset.zip`).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Core Objectives:\n",
    "1. **Extract Vehicle Brand/Make**: Parse clean brand attributes from `Vehicle Name`.\n",
    "2. **Left Join Enhancement**: Perform a left join with the left side being Indonesia's EV dataset (`indonesia_ev_specs_pricing_2026.csv`) and the right side being the complete global EV specification dataset (`electric_vehicles_spec_2025.csv`).\n",
    "3. **Data Cleansing & Normalisation**: Standardize battery capacity (kWh), driving range (km), power (hp), top speed (km/h), seating capacity, charging performance, and price brackets.\n",
    "4. **Deduplication**: Enforce single car listing per model/variant so each car appears exactly once in the dataset.\n",
    "5. **Export & DB Integration**: Export tidied CSVs and sync with backend database tables."
   ],
   "id": "intro-markdown"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Setup & Environment Initialisation"
   ],
   "id": "setup-header"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import io\n",
    "import os\n",
    "import re\n",
    "import zipfile\n",
    "from pathlib import Path\n",
    "\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\", palette=\"muted\")
   ],
   "id": "setup-imports"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Load Raw Datasets from `ev_dataset.zip`"
   ],
   "id": "load-header"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "ZIP_PATH = Path(\"ev_dataset.zip\")\n",
    "\n",
    "with zipfile.ZipFile(ZIP_PATH) as z:\n",
    "    print(\"Archive contents:\", z.namelist())\n",
    "    df_id_raw = pd.read_csv(io.BytesIO(z.read(\"indonesia_ev_specs_pricing_2026.csv\")))\n",
    "    df_global_raw = pd.read_csv(io.BytesIO(z.read(\"electric_vehicles_spec_2025.csv\")))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Indonesia EV Dataset Shape: {df_id_raw.shape}\")\n",
    "print(f\"Global EV Specs Dataset Shape: {df_global_raw.shape}\")\n",
    "display(df_id_raw.head())"
   ],
   "id": "load-code"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Brand Extraction & Feature Engineering"
   ],
   "id": "brand-header"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def extract_brand(name: str) -> str:\n",
    "    if not isinstance(name, str) or not name.strip():\n",
    "        return \"Unknown\"\n",
    "    parts = name.strip().split()\n",
    "    first = parts[0]\n",
    "    first_lower = first.lower()\n",
    "    if first_lower == \"vinfast\":\n",
    "        return \"VinFast\"\n",
    "    if first_lower == \"byd\":\n",
    "        return \"BYD\"\n",
    "    if first_lower == \"bmw\":\n",
    "        return \"BMW\"\n",
    "    if first_lower == \"mg\":\n",
    "        return \"MG\"\n",
    "    if len(parts) > 1 and f\"{parts[0]} {parts[1]}\".lower() in [\"mercedes-benz\", \"rolls royce\", \"aston martin\"]:\n",
    "        return f\"{parts[0]} {parts[1]}\".title()\n",
    "    return first.capitalize()\n",
    "\n",
    "df_id_raw[\"brand\"] = df_id_raw[\"Vehicle Name\"].apply(extract_brand)\n",
    "print(\"Brand Breakdown in Indonesia Dataset:\")\n",
    "print(df_id_raw[\"brand\"].value_counts())"
   ],
   "id": "brand-code"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Left Join Strategy (Left: Indonesia Dataset, Right: Complete EV Specs)"
   ],
   "id": "join-header"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from scripts.wrangle_ev_dataset import wrangle\n",
    "\n",
    "cleaned_records = wrangle()\n",
    "df_cleaned = pd.DataFrame(cleaned_records)\n",
    "print(f\"Tidy EV Dataset Shape: {df_cleaned.shape}\")\n",
    "display(df_cleaned.head(10))"
   ],
   "id": "join-code"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Deduplication Verification (Single Car per Model)"
   ],
   "id": "dedup-header"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "dups = df_cleaned[df_cleaned.duplicated(subset=[\"id\"], keep=False)]\n",
    "print(f\"Duplicate records count: {len(dups)}\")\n",
    "assert len(dups) == 0, \"Validation failed: dataset contains duplicates!\"\n",
    "print(\"✓ Unique listing policy verified: 1 car per vehicle model.\")"
   ],
   "id": "dedup-code"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Exploratory Data Analysis & Visualizations"
   ],
   "id": "eda-header"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.countplot(data=df_cleaned, y=\"brand\", order=df_cleaned[\"brand\"].value_counts().index, ax=axes[0], palette=\"viridis\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"EV Fleet Count by Brand in Indonesia\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Number of Models\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel(\"Brand\")\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.scatterplot(data=df_cleaned, x=\"battery_kwh\", y=\"range_km\", hue=\"brand\", s=100, ax=axes[1])\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Battery Capacity (kWh) vs. Range (km)\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Battery Capacity (kWh)\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_ylabel(\"Claimed Range (km)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"data/processed/ev_fleet_analysis.png\", dpi=300)\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ],
   "id": "eda-code"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
